[Sheet: Header]
Equipment Schedule: Corwyn Office Complex PV (PXA-2023-0629)
Brantley Electric Company · Alleron Electrical Contractor Lic. #EC-12306
Drawing E-101 Rev C, 06/24/2025. A 700 kW ac parking-canopy array at the Corwyn Office Complex: five canopies, one Vexlar VX-140C inverter (140 kW ac, 480 V, 3-phase) per canopy over the surface lots beside the parking structure, PV switchboard SWBD-PV, step-up transformer T-1 and the 13.2 kV point of interconnection on feeder ALN-072.
Prepared: K. Osei, Electrical Engineer, Brantley Electric Company, 06/24/2025.
[Sheet: Equipment]
Tag	Equipment	Location	Data	Mounting
T-1	T-1: 750 kVA, 13.2 kV grounded wye to 480Y/277 V	Equipment yard, north lot	Pad-mounted, liquid-filled; impedance 5.75 %; secondary cable bus to SWBD-PV	Cast-in-place concrete pad
PSW-1	T-1 primary switch: 15 kV, 200 A load-break, with 65E current-limiting fuses	Equipment yard	Pad-mounted, padlockable; T-1 full-load primary current 32.8 A	Cast-in-place concrete pad
