INV-C1 to INV-C5	Vexlar VX-140C inverter, one per canopy, NEMA 3R	East-end column of each canopy, within the curbed planting island; concrete-filled steel bollard on the drive side; working space faces the island walkway	Rated ac current 168 A at 480 V; integral PV arc-fault protection; control power internal, from the inverter's own ac output terminals	Column bracket, 1.2 m above grade
